    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d106">

                <pb facs="0138" n="64" xml:id="pg64"/>

                <head>Mr. Burnley to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 4, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> With reference to your notes of the 13th of
                    October and the 29th of November, and to my note of the 30th of November, I have
                    the honor to transmit to you herewith a copy of a despatch which I have received
                    from his excellency the governor general of Canada, stating that he has issued
                    his warrant for the extradition of Bennet G. Burley.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. HUME BURNLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d106-a1.xml" xpointer="d106-a1"/>
